    <briefdescription>
<para>Primary hypergraph traits structure that encapsulates all necessary type information for hypergraph representations. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This structure serves as the central point for defining the properties and types associated with a hypergraph, including directionality, element properties, as well as representation and identifier types. It provides a clean, extensible way to customize hypergraph behavior.</para>
